1. **Campaign id** — `7b4e11c4-cb79-4f37-97e3-a1a10d7d2ace`, from stdout
   `[EVENT] campaign_id=…` or `final_report.json → campaign_id`.
2. **Best point / values** — `final_report.json → best_parameters`, `best_raw_response`,
